<title>SINGAPORE: HPL buys more stock in Planet Hollywood.</title>
<headline>HPL buys more stock in Planet Hollywood.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hotel Properties Ltd (HPL) said on Wednesday it had raised its stake in Planet Hollywood International Inc to around 21 percent.</p>
<p>HPL said in a statement it bought 1.37 million more Class A stocks in Planet Hollywood, raising the number it held to 22.65 million.</p>
<p>It made the purchase through Leisure Ventures Pte Ltd, which is 50-percent owned by HPL through HPL Singapore Pte Ltd, the statement said.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 870 3080)</p>
